  "description": "Sleeping with the enemy... literally.\nAfter Duke Louison is given a second chance at life, he sets out to save the people he had so terribly failed by surrendering himself to the enemy. Yet little does he know that crossing paths with an enemy knight — the noble-hating Carlton — would become so... intimate. Things are about to get messy! \n\n(Source: Manta)",
